{"book":"ezekiel","num":45,"verses":[{"en":"Moreover, when ye shall divide by lot the land for inheritance, ye shall offer an oblation unto the LORD, an holy portion of the land: the length shall be the length of five and twenty thousand reeds, and the breadth shall be ten thousand. This shall be holy in all the borders thereof round about.","n":1,"sm":"A outou vaevaeina le laueleele i le vili e fai ma tofi, tou te avatua se taulaga i le ALII, o le mea paia mai le laueleele; o lona umi e lua sefulu o afe ma afe e lima o u, o lona umi lea, o lona lautele foi e sefulu afe. E paia foi lea i ona itu uma e soo ai.","w":[{"en":"","sm":"A"},{"en":"","sm":"outou"},{"en":"","sm":"vaevaeina"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"laueleele"},{"en":"","sm":"i"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"vili"},{"en":"","sm":"e"},{"en":"","sm":"fai"},{"en":"","sm":"ma"},{"en":"","sm":"tofi,"},{"en":"","sm":"tou"},{"en":"","sm":"te"},{"en":"","sm":"avatua"},{"en":"","sm":"se"},{"en":"","sm":"taulaga"},{"en":"","sm":"i"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"ALII,"},{"en":"","sm":"o"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"mea"},{"en":"","sm":"paia"},{"en":"","sm":"mai"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"laueleele;"},{"en":"","sm":"o"},{"en":"","sm":"lona"},{"en":"","sm":"umi"},{"en":"","sm":"e"},{"en":"","sm":"lua"},{"en":"","sm":"sefulu"},{"en":"","sm":"o"},{"en":"","sm":"afe"},{"en":"","sm":"ma"},{"en":"","sm":"afe"},{"en":"","sm":"e"},{"en":"","sm":"lima"},{"en":"","sm":"o"},{"en":"","sm":"u,"},{"en":"","sm":"o"},{"en":"","sm":"lona"},{"en":"","sm":"umi"},{"en":"","sm":"lea,"},{"en":"","sm":"o"},{"en":"","sm":"lona"},{"en":"","sm":"lautele"},{"en":"","sm":"foi"},{"en":"","sm":"e"},{"en":"","sm":"sefulu"},{"en":"","sm":"afe."},{"en":"","sm":"E"},{"en":"","sm":"paia"},{"en":"","sm":"foi"},{"en":"","sm":"lea"},{"en":"","sm":"i"},{"en":"","sm":"ona"},{"en":"","sm":"itu"},{"en":"","sm":"uma"},{"en":"","sm":"e"},{"en":"","sm":"soo"},{"en":"","sm":"ai."}]},{"en":"Of this there shall be for the sanct